        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# Correlation Timeline Query\\nUse this dashboard variable pair to fetch exact lifecycle lineage from API.\\n\\n1. Set `correlation_id` or `job_id` below.\\n2. Run the curl command shown in panel source.\\n3. Correlate spikes in retry/failover/timeout with returned events.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "title": "Incident Workflow",
      "type": "text"
    },
